ENGLISH
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Ownership. The source code, design and content of this repository
   (including the catalogues and texts in data/ and the images in img/) are
   the property of the author. Public visibility of the repository grants no
   permission of any kind.

2. Use by permission only. The tool may only be used by people expressly
   authorised by the author. Authorisation is personal, non-transferable and
   may be withdrawn by the author at any time without giving reasons. Once it
   is withdrawn, use of the tool and of any copy of it must stop.

3. Restrictions. Without the author's prior written permission, you may not
   copy, modify, adapt, redistribute, publish, host elsewhere, sublicense or
   sell this code or its content, in whole or in part.

4. Users' data. Data entered by each user is stored in their own browser and,
   if they set it up, in their own account and repository. It is that user's
   responsibility, and they must comply with applicable data protection law.
   The tool must never receive patient-identifying data.

5. No warranty. The tool is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
   It is not a medical device and does not replace clinical judgement:
   monitoring and clinical decisions are solely the responsibility of the
   professional using it. The author accepts no liability for any damage
   arising from its use.
